#: db0ca21da2b24019823855b79b893b3e
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:43 2eefefcfbd0041e685066208afdd5d8f
#: bcbc537e5f8e4025a1afc60faae3c466
msgid ""
"The parachute release mechanism can be triggered from either a Relay or a "
"PWM (i.e. Servo). Be sure that if a Relay pin is used, that the parachute "
"release is active on a high level and that the Relay pin default, "
"``RELAY_DEFAULT`` is OFF or No Change, to avoid triggering the release "
"during initialization, since all GPIOs are forced low during the bootloader "
"period."
msgstr ""
"降落伞释放机构可通过继电器或 PWM（即舵机）触发。如果使用继电器引脚，请确保降落伞释放在高电平时激活，且继电器引脚默认值 "
"``RELAY_DEFAULT`` 为 OFF 或 No Change，以避免在初始化时意外触发释放，因为在引导程序期间所有 GPIO 均被强制拉低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:50 38331e43f3eb40d7bb741a2cc53f5fa1
#: b429b9f3af2947b797491861531e860e bc9bc4efada44d6997b0e865e25587ae
#: e071ecc740aa41a595c47f288d76fc29
msgid "Setup through the Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:52 2a97736323b14924b3991252632a04bb
#: 3c2f83b28f714e499950539348ae1da9 8f2f517719e94c4e88a94216141f2d09
#: defdece5966d4654ab7a054aaab4da97
msgid ""
"To configure the parachute release, first connect to the autopilot with "
"Mission Planner, and then open the CONFIG->Full Parameter List tab and set "
"the following parameters."
msgstr ""
"要配置降落伞释放，首先使用 Mission Planner 连接到飞控，然后打开 CONFIG->Full Parameter List "
"选项卡并设置以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:56 14e4e99c577049a2b13c169bcdf06426
#: 78dfc86b64244cb9a16779efb582ad94 8a7af43d0fd441b18aed4e745320ecec
#: ba9b2c9c430649938ea7b4a4487eaae2
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_ENABLED <CHUTE_ENABLED>` = \"1\". Then refresh parameters, or "
"reboot, to see the Chute parameters."
msgstr ":ref:`CHUTE_ENABLED <CHUTE_ENABLED>` = 「1」。然后刷新参数或重启，以查看 Chute 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:57 5694e407283142648956712c2e0b2983
#: 7767b84f692c48f9b03aa5e83b00dce6 b896b03aa1e34e3282246d172660222e
#: c44d1e2a6fc142fdabc7df27be9aed49
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_CRT_SINK<CHUTE_CRT_SINK>` should be set to the sink rate in m/s "
"that will trigger the chute release."
msgstr ":ref:`CHUTE_CRT_SINK<CHUTE_CRT_SINK>` 应设置为触发降落伞释放的下沉速率（m/s）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:58 1bc1bca7196d485a9730ae3821aeee16
#: bee97ce681974c0a9f0eca5c8cacc7f1
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN<CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` determines the minimum altitude above "
"HOME that allows parachute release to occur."
msgstr ":ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN<CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` 确定允许降落伞释放的最小 Home 上方高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:61 2a0462f1e0f243f5b78771f48f701139
#: 56d291a49d2c4a518706aad72f095f53 82e6d02013c94304ac91a75785793395
#: eb18f8a9efe54ae798e92d9c107e58c4
msgid "Servo Release"
msgstr "舵机释放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:63 1cd0230443374f13928a3ff81056af08
#: f560e2c61d634787a7f720d4d51a8e96 faa56862df5d450aa411639c5f7632bb
#: fcf1ad2f42f8457ba9d94cd6c339069c
msgid ":ref:`CHUTE_TYPE <CHUTE_TYPE>` = \"10\" to release with a servo"
msgstr ":ref:`CHUTE_TYPE <CHUTE_TYPE>` = 「10」以使用舵机释放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:64 2945b41ffc604d0a857f83efae319c17
#: d25f24bb55c64c929464d5c53c74b434 d5a1164ea3e844a09eb09da010402285
#: f89ed00c2ad54125827ae026776fd115
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_SERVO_ON <CHUTE_SERVO_ON>` should be set to the servo position "
"required to release the parachute"
msgstr ":ref:`CHUTE_SERVO_ON <CHUTE_SERVO_ON>` 应设置为释放降落伞所需的舵机位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:65 0f73a6b929234b1eaff73336c1a5ef5f
#: 2b61ec58249e4156b93d1c4639042b92 31d26d098c20406d8f1aa7a472baee0e
#: c94663b9f1354fb1a7a353f756ab53ce
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_SERVO_OFF <CHUTE_SERVO_OFF>` should be the \"resting\" servo "
"position.  I.e. the position the servo is in before the parachute is "
"released"
msgstr ":ref:`CHUTE_SERVO_OFF <CHUTE_SERVO_OFF>` 应为舵机的「静止」位置，即降落伞释放前舵机所在的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:66 4c01075ffc8d45348f61a7bb9e83a64a
#: 6bec98359dc34d51806c687a9c2d8ecc 7df1e645c1aa4ffca322ca742faebf80
#: aa734a32333a4004adae85ffa66dc1ad
msgid ""
"set :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = \"27\". On autopilots with an"
" IOMCU (Outputs labeled MAIN and AUX), ``SERVO9`` refers to the Pixhawk's "
"AUX OUT 1. To use AUX OUT2 instead set :ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO10_FUNCTION>` to 27, etc."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设置为 「27」。在有 IOMCU 的飞控上（输出标记为 MAIN"
" 和 AUX），``SERVO9`` 对应 Pixhawk 的 AUX OUT 1。要使用 AUX OUT2，改将 "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` 设置为 27，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:69 7b5e724190b549e3ba746fddb5f8df58
#: ada4691ab93a466f8e2d7e9e04e6a727 ddbb67601fe1433295278111be449dfa
#: e4a4aa066f51487cac12a07ffcaed343
msgid "Relay Release"
msgstr "继电器释放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:72 677383f2c86e4b048d04c899614f52f5
#: 934c9734fde148f59de9750f9344a5c2 96a82074359e4ddc9e4573d64ddf12cc
#: 9e73e669ffd4431dad3e7062992fd0c3
msgid ""
":ref:`This function is a GPIO and has limited current capabilities.<gpio-"
"warning>`"
msgstr ":ref:`此功能为 GPIO，电流能力有限。<gpio-warning>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:74 5390b527c7f04bc7b418394386db07cd
#: 7ddb79ea96ff40b78d91ac64c036317a 86e26dad3e734ce8a3ea8e173438096f
#: ccff7585e2ed4064b33ca2db36c7e554
msgid "Determine/Configure a pin to be a GPIO (see :ref:`common-gpios`)."
msgstr "确定/配置一个引脚为 GPIO（参见 :ref:`common-gpios`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:75 36f83ee2d3404aa586144abd7ef0e5c3
#: 8b1c175f74ca4947b9ed86fdd6156344
msgid ""
"Set that pin number as one of the RELAY functions. ie For GPIO pin 51 using "
"the first RELAY function, set :ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = 51."
msgstr ""
"将该引脚编号设置为 RELAY 功能之一。例如，对于 GPIO 引脚 51 使用第一个 RELAY 功能，将 "
":ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = 51。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:76 12807fe76ef94cdead8c41699452de3e
#: d1ab30df102a4ee1a14b99dfc1b6fa12
msgid ""
"Since GPIOs are always set low initially during the bootloader period, to "
"avoid accidental release, always use a release mechanism that needs a high "
"output level to trigger and set:"
msgstr "由于 GPIO 在引导程序期间始终初始设置为低电平，为避免意外释放，请始终使用需要高电平输出才能触发的释放机构，并设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:77 02425cef835140999d6b9cf70a8e3690
#: 8bcf2f19a0044dea96f96692a327e52d
msgid ""
":ref:`RELAY1_DEFAULT<RELAY1_DEFAULT>` = 1 or 2 (low or no change), which "
"determines how RELAY1 pins is set during the post-bootloader, autopilot "
"initialization period."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RELAY1_DEFAULT<RELAY1_DEFAULT>` = 1 或 2（低电平或不变），这决定了在引导程序后飞控初始化期间 "
"RELAY1 引脚的设置状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:78 94ef33ed722642f9ac9f06307aef95c4
#: dbeb0ad56865477fbbac5194213d6e18
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_TYPE <CHUTE_TYPE>` = 0,1,2,or 3 to release with RELAY, RELAY2, "
"RELAY3, or RELAY4 functions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CHUTE_TYPE <CHUTE_TYPE>` = 0、1、2 或 3，分别使用 RELAY、RELAY2、RELAY3 或 RELAY4"
" 功能释放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:86
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:87 0fdcbc26b48641fa8d41943e3bb617a9
#: 6ce3bfa481644a978d39ba966c040c3c 6f767c95499949fba5aa4fd83940745b
#: 793b322f431a4c0c920722621e0afaae
msgid "Manual Release"
msgstr "手动释放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:88
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:89 2edca13470d54a8794d83b3c0bc0548d
#: 44fcabcbbb744b9696c9cd7082dcad07 b201c152fc1946d29078495caa3d2bee
#: dfebfa63d27242c18868ff79d1683ea2
msgid ""
"The pilot can manually release the parachute using an RC channel/switch: set"
" an ``RCx_OPTION`` to either 22 (Parachute Release) or 23 (Parachute 3Pos). "
"Either function, when the RC channel is high, above "
":ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN<CHUTE_ALT_MIN>`, and is armed (Copter) or flying "
"(Plane). See following section for requirements."
msgstr ""
"飞手可使用 RC 通道/开关手动释放降落伞：将 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为 22（Parachute Release）或 "
"23（Parachute 3Pos）。在 RC 通道处于高位、高于 :ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN<CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` "
"且已解锁（Copter）或飞行中（Plane）时，任一功能均可触发。请参阅下节了解要求。"

