#: 815f4f0e1b5046689c9e5ed145ba72ce c9b8c2f9a6f94caba9ee9d9876394d8b
#: d14434fcf2624504835935ee5f148422
msgid "Parachute Options"
msgstr "降落伞选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:111
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:112
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:117
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:118 68b2f2196b2541a18a41c85e420a5c06
#: 6ec7178556624c9d8e07ccd5adaa72ab 8b1b0ed7edc541dfbff2415d2a092e2e
#: de677ba8389d4cfb89e73fb460a7cc62
msgid ""
"An option to force the release servo or relay to remain active forever "
"(until reboot) once triggered. This used in high altitude situations where "
"the servo or relay may be frozen due to extremely low temperatures, until "
"lower altitude, and warmer temperatures allow operation. This can be enabled"
" by setting the :ref:`CHUTE_OPTIONS<CHUTE_OPTIONS>` bit 0 high."
msgstr ""
"有一个选项可强制释放舵机或继电器在触发后保持永久激活（直到重启）。这用于高空场景，在极低温度下舵机或继电器可能冻结，待降低高度温度升高后才能正常操作。可通过将"
" :ref:`CHUTE_OPTIONS<CHUTE_OPTIONS>` 的第 0 位设置为高来启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:113
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:114
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:119
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:120 1db0fb1faad0422d868e04c2eb4f4a99
#: 26dfdc3a6d0e4c4cac3994d74c491b7f c709b90a4e884ebe96cc80653a251874
#: fffb3374909b4918914a025514d9c087
msgid ""
"Setting bit 1 high of :ref:`CHUTE_OPTIONS<CHUTE_OPTIONS>` will not disarm "
"the vehicle before releasing the chute."
msgstr "将 :ref:`CHUTE_OPTIONS<CHUTE_OPTIONS>` 的第 1 位设置为高，将在释放降落伞前不上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:116
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:117
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:122
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:123 92d73d5be0e5458399ec0be0e817bec4
#: a3e67fab88014e82af45df253e8d2056 e314c00fdcaf4c02823cf21cf4252b54
#: e4d37d9a158e4f6e966361b6c5d79df2
msgid "RC Disable/Enable of Parachute"
msgstr "通过 RC 禁用/启用降落伞"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:119
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:125 47b7728332ef4342b3f018f32775b99b
#: a6cd92ce19b04a358aec78469baf652c
msgid ""
"You can disable or enable the parachute automatic release using an RC "
"channel/switch: set an ``RCx_OPTION`` to 21. A high enables the automatic "
"release function, low disables it. Manual release is unaffected. If set to "
"23 (Parachute 3Pos), the low position disables, middle position enables auto"
" operation, a high will attempt to force release, as explained above, "
"assuming the enabling conditions described below."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 RC 通道/开关禁用或启用降落伞自动释放：将 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为 "
"21。高电平启用自动释放功能，低电平禁用。手动释放不受影响。如果设置为 23（Parachute "
"3Pos），低位禁用，中位启用自动操作，高位将在满足下述启用条件的情况下尝试强制释放。"

