"After the test is complete, return the :ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN <CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` "
"to the desired altitude (default is 10m)"
msgstr "测试完成后，将 :ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN <CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` 恢复至所需高度（默认为 10m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:109
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:110 13635527f3764674b6ed3262aba20bca
#: 63961bd2c3c04260a2e52fab2cfefd1a
msgid "Failsafe Action"
msgstr "失控保护动作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:111
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:112 9702225568994faf9a88db229c96243e
#: 97b5fc83bb5843a0bdecb01f7105059d
msgid ""
"Plane also provides for a parachute release failsafe action for "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` and ``BATTx_FS_CRT_ACT``."
msgstr ""
"Plane 还为 :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` 和 ``BATTx_FS_CRT_ACT`` "
"提供了降落伞释放失控保护动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:43 434e214feeac4868b9d3fbcf26a4bd8c
#: 80c67e00b3ac4209b3a4b7c9484a22d4
msgid ""
"The parachute release mechanism can be triggered from either a Relay or a "
"PWM (i.e. Servo). If a Relay pin is used, use a release mechanism that "
"requires a high output level to trigger, since GPIOs are forced low during "
"the bootloader period, and set the corresponding ``RELAYx_DEFAULT`` to OFF "
"or No Change to avoid triggering the release during autopilot "
"initialization."
msgstr ""
"降落伞释放机构可由继电器（Relay）或 PWM（即舵机）触发。若使用继电器引脚，请选用需要高电平输出才能触发的释放机构，因为在 bootloader "
"期间 GPIO 会被强制拉低；并将对应的 ``RELAYx_DEFAULT`` 设为 OFF 或 No Change，以避免在飞控初始化期间误触发释放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:58 101971d8b51745ddb5f481d967661b6e
#: 187b79d2513740cf87d701e7e040392d
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN<CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` determines the minimum altitude above "
"HOME required for automatic parachute release to occur when loss of control "
"is first detected ."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN<CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` 决定了首次检测到失控时，触发自动开伞所需的相对 HOME 的最低高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:75 10bf3bbb51f04203bbc0b04449f835f3
#: 60778f461caa4ea78b152331c0c9e401
msgid ""
"Set that pin number as one of the RELAY outputs and assign that relay to the"
" parachute function. For example, for GPIO pin 51 using the first relay, set"
" :ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = 51 and "
":ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>` = 3 (Parachute)."
msgstr ""
"将该引脚编号设置为 RELAY 输出之一，并将该继电器分配给降落伞功能。例如，GPIO 引脚 51 使用第一个继电器时，设置 "
":ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = 51 和 :ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>`"
" = 3（Parachute）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:76 6c6e32849f4647fe9be97319b764d143
#: 9865fdac2b0f49d29d8f395876548b6a
msgid ""
"Since GPIOs are always set low initially during the bootloader period, to "
"avoid accidental release, always use a release mechanism that needs a high "
"output level to trigger and set."
msgstr "由于在 bootloader 期间 GPIO 初始状态始终为低电平，为避免意外开伞，请始终使用需要高电平输出才能触发的释放机构。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:77 3fd3234274d746f69a9b7b6f723b91ee
#: 44e8be5fbc9c41bcbe36026288e86869
msgid ""
":ref:`CHUTE_TYPE<CHUTE_TYPE>` = 0 to release with a relay. Set the "
"corresponding relay function parameter, such as "
":ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>` (for RELAY1), to 3 (Parachute) to "
"choose which relay output is used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CHUTE_TYPE<CHUTE_TYPE>` = 0 表示用继电器释放。将对应的继电器功能参数（例如 RELAY1 对应的 "
":ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>`）设为 3（Parachute），以选择使用哪个继电器输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:118
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:124 4c8a4187fa6e41ab9a5cd23f6db86664
#: d5c1db00616c4415a4d8b1839c5c9130
msgid ""
"You can disable or enable parachute release using an RC channel/switch: set "
"an ``RCx_OPTION`` to 21. A high position enables parachute release; other "
"positions disable it. If an ``RCx_OPTION`` is set to 23 (Parachute 3Pos), "
"the low position disables parachute release, middle position enables "
"operation, and a high will attempt to force release, as explained above, "
"assuming the enabling conditions described below."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过遥控器通道/开关来禁用或启用降落伞释放：将某个 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设为 21。开关高位启用降落伞释放；其他位置则禁用。如果将某个 "
"``RCx_OPTION`` 设为 23（Parachute "
"3Pos），则低位禁用降落伞释放，中位启用，高位将如上文所述尝试强制开伞（假定满足下文所述的启用条件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:123
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:129 9b71246511d24c7ea7b358c99f433a8a
#: b7cd57e09116455bbe0c8b3f9f0eae90
msgid ""
"Automatic parachute release can occur when the vehicle has lost attitude "
"control and has begun falling. The following must all be true for a full 1 "
"second for automatic release to trigger:"
msgstr "当飞行器失去姿态控制并开始下坠时，可能触发自动开伞。以下条件必须全部满足并持续整整 1 秒，才会触发自动开伞："

#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:131
#: ../../source/docs/common-parachute.rst:137 1ee6716ee30d43b4943bb60ebad487ea
#: 2af0b152976049958f9e90218f4db2e4
msgid ""
"the vehicle is above the :ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN <CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` altitude when "
"loss of control is first detected (Copter only). In a fast descent, the "
"actual release may occur below this altitude. A value of \"0\" disables this"
" check."
msgstr ""
"首次检测到失控时，飞行器高于 :ref:`CHUTE_ALT_MIN <CHUTE_ALT_MIN>` 高度（仅 "
"Copter）。在快速下降中，实际开伞可能发生在该高度以下。设为 \"0\" 可禁用此检查。"
